cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "ctddump"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that converts oceanographic CTD (Conductivity,
  Temperature, Depth) profiles from NetCDF (Copernicus Marine NRT and CORA, or
  any similarly laid-out file) to Parquet and YAML, and cleans, de-duplicates,
  compares and summarises them.
authors:
  - family-names: "Saito"
    given-names: "Takaya"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AIQC-Hub/ctddump"
url: "https://aiqc-hub.github.io/ctddump/"
license: MIT
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24091418"
keywords:
  - oceanography
  - CTD
  - NetCDF
  - Parquet
  - Copernicus Marine
version: "0.37.2"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
